# ---- Datasets over 50 MB ----
# GitHub rejects files over 100 MB and warns above 50 MB. Git can't ignore by size,
# so list any big dataset here by name. Find them with:
#   find . -type f -size +50M -not -path "./.git/*"
# (none right now: the largest file in this repo is ~3 MB)
*.zip
*.parquet
*.h5
*.pkl

